ments":1,"created_at":"2025-12-27T20:03:28Z","updated_at":"2025-12-28T18:32:34Z","closed_at":"2025-12-28T18:31:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Godot 4.3 stable (Android)\n- Godot 4.4.x stable (Android)\n- Godot 4.5.1 stable (Android)\n- Possibly also affects Godot 3.6 (not fully tested)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot 4.5.1 ,android, Samsung galaxy tab a8 \n\n### Issue description\n\n### Godot version\nGodot 4.5.1 stable (official build)\n\n### Operating system\nAndroid\n\n### Device\nSamsung Galaxy Tab A8\n\n### Issue description\nWhile writing code in the Godot built-in script editor, the code gets corrupted automatically.\nCharacters are duplicated, removed, or replaced without user input.\nSometimes entire sections of the script become filled with repeated symbols.\n\nThis happens during normal typing and makes coding impossible.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n1. Open Godot 4.5.1 on Android\n2. Open or create any GDScript file\n3. Start typing code normally\n4. The editor modifies the code automatically\n\n### Expected result\nThe script editor should not modify the code unless the user types or deletes something.\n\n### Actual result\nThe code becomes corrupted automatically while typing.\n\n### Additional information\n- Happens consistently\n- Tested on Samsung Galaxy Tab A8\n- On-screen keyboard is used\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1200\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ab1a8e4f-7416-4df6-b821-74e07ec93c96\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open Godot on Android\n2. Create a new project or open any existing project\n3. Create or open a GDScript file\n4. Start typing code normally in the script editor\n5. After a short time, the editor starts duplicating or corrupting characters automatically\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot applicable. The issue happens in a fresh empty project and is related to the script editor itself.","closed_by":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114380/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114380/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}